OL,3,AMan dies after tiger attack at wildlife
OL,4,Apark
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being attacked by
OL,7,Fa tiger at Yorkshire Wildlife Park,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it had been
OL,11,Fcalled at 13:35 BST to reports of a man
OL,12,Fentering the tiger enclosure at the
OL,13,Fattraction near Doncaster. The tiger
OL,14,Fthen attacked the man and he died at
OL,15,Fthe scene, the force said.
OL,17,FHis family had been informed and were
OL,18,Fbeing supported by officers, it added.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
