OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Saudi-led military coalition has
OL,7,Fvowed to respond to the attack, which
OL,8,Fit has blamed on the Houthis and called
OL,9,Fa "war crime".
OL,11,FFighting has recently escalated between
OL,12,FYemen's Saudi-backed government forces
OL,13,Fand the Houthis, who control most of
OL,14,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
